               RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
           "rules"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"b", " ", "/.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"SubscriptBox", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "s_"}], "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", 
           RowBox[{"SubscriptBox", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"s", " ", "/.", " ", "r"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"SuperscriptBox", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "s_"}], "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", 
           RowBox[{"SuperscriptBox", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"s", " ", "/.", " ", "r"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "        ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"SubsuperscriptBox", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "s1_", ",", " ", "s2_"}], "]"}], " ", ":>",
            " ", 
           RowBox[{"SubsuperscriptBox", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"s1", " ", "/.", " ", "r"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"s2", " ", "/.", " ", "r"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SL31Instance", "[", 
      RowBox[{"b_", ",", " ", "rules_List"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"SL31Symbolize", "[", 
      RowBox[{"replaceIndex", "[", 
       RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "rules"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "boxes", " ", "that", " ", "are", " ", "symbolized", " ", 
      "for", " ", "a", " ", "registered", " ", "TeX", " ", "item"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"by", " ", 
      RowBox[{"kind", ":", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", " ", "a"}], " ", "single", " ", "letter", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"D", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"the", " ", "dimension", " ", "count"}]}], ")"}], " ", "is",
         " ", "wrapped", " ", "in", " ", 
        RowBox[{"TagBox", "[", 
         RowBox[{"..", ",", " ", "\"\<SL31Plain\>\""}], "]"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "so", " ", "that", " ", "the", "\n", "     ", "ordinary", " ", "letter",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
        "for", " ", "example", " ", "the", " ", "derivative", " ", "D", " ", 
         "of", " ", "the", " ", "Wolfram", " ", "Language"}], ")"}], " ", 
       "keeps", " ", "its", " ", "meaning"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", " ", "a"}], " ", "group", " ", "name"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "a", " ", "ket", " ", "or", " ", "another", " ", "expression", " ", 
      "whose", " ", "boxes", " ", "begin", " ", "with", " ", "RowBox", " ", 
      "is", " ", "wrapped", " ", "in", "\n", "     ", 
      RowBox[{"TagBox", "[", 
       RowBox[{"..", ",", " ", "\"\<SL31Name\>\""}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "because", " ", "the", " ", "Notation", " ", "package", " ", "cannot", " ",
        "symbolize", " ", "a", " ", "RowBox"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", " ", "a"}], " ", "function", " ", "symbol", " ", "W", 
       RowBox[{"(", "u", ")"}], " ", "gives", " ", "the", " ", "boxes", " ", 
       "of", " ", "its", " ", "head", " ", "W"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", " ", "every"}], " ", "other", " ", "kind", " ", "gives", " ",
        "its", " ", "boxes", " ", 
       RowBox[{"unchanged", "."}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SL31Symbolized", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<family\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<function\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<function family\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<letter\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<group\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<ket\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<expression\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<primed index\>\""}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "innermost", " ", "base", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ", "box", " ",
      "with", " ", "scripts", " ", "or", " ", "an", " ", "accent"}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"baseOf", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
        "SubscriptBox", " ", "|", " ", "SuperscriptBox", " ", "|", " ", 
         "SubsuperscriptBox", " ", "|", " ", "OverscriptBox"}], ")"}], "[", 
       RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "__"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"baseOf", "[", "x", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"baseOf", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "x"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "a", " ", "box", " ", "whose", " ", "base", " ", "is", " ", "an", " ", 
      "operator", " ", "sign"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"such", " ", "as", " ", "the", " ", "partial"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"derivative", " ", "sign", " ", "or", " ", "nabla"}]}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "would", " ", "be", "\n", "   ", "read", " ", "by", " ", "the", " ", 
      "front", " ", "end", " ", "as", " ", "an", " ", "operator", " ", 
      "applied", " ", "to", " ", "what", " ", "follows", " ", "it"}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"operatorBaseQ", "[", "b_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"x", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"baseOf", "[", "b", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"StringQ", "[", "x", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
        RowBox[{"x", " ", "=!=", " ", "\"\<\>\""}], " ", "&&", " ", 
        RowBox[{"!", " ", 
         RowBox[{"LetterQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{"StringTake", "[", 
           RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "&&", " ", 
        RowBox[{"!", " ", 
         RowBox[{"DigitQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{"StringTake", "[", 
           RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"TagBox", "[", 
       RowBox[{"..", ",", " ", "\"\<SL31Name\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"SyntaxForm", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<symbol\>\""}]}], "]"}], " ",
       "makes", " ", "the", " ", "front", " ", "end", " ", "treat", " ", 
      "its", " ", "content", " ", "as", " ", "ONE", "\n", "   ", "operand"}], 
     ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"like", " ", "a", " ", "symbol"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"wherever", " ", "it", " ", "stands"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"asName", "[", "b_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TagBox", "[", 
      RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "\"\<SL31Name\>\"", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"SyntaxForm", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<symbol\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SL31SymbolBoxes", "[", "tex_String", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"b", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"SL31TeXToBoxes", "[", "tex", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "k", ",", 
         " ", "r"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"k", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SL31Classify", "[", 
          RowBox[{"tex", ",", " ", "b"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Switch", "[", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", "\n", "    ", "\"\<letter\>\"", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"TagBox", "[", 
            RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "\"\<SL31Plain\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
           "    ", "\"\<expression\>\"", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"asName", "[", "b", "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "|", " ", "\"\<ket\>\""}], ",", " ", 
           
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Head", "[", "b", "]"}], " ", "===", " ", "RowBox"}], ",",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"asName", "[", "b", "]"}], ",", " ", "b"}], "]"}], ",", 
           "\n", "    ", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<function\>\"", " ", "|", 
            " ", "\"\<function family\>\""}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"SL31Head", "[", "b", "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", "_", ",", 
           " ", "b"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Head", "[", "r", "]"}], " ", "=!=", " ", "TagBox"}], " ",
            "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"operatorBaseQ", "[", "r", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asName", "[", "r", "]"}], ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}]}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "boxes", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ", "registered", " ", "TeX", 
      " ", "symbol"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "with", " ", "optional", " ", "index", " ", "values", " ", "given", " ", 
      "as", " ", "TeX", " ", "strings"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SL31`Build`symbolBoxes", "[", 
      RowBox[{"tex_String", ",", " ", "rules___Rule"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"b", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SL31SymbolBoxes", "[", "tex", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
       "  ", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", "rules", "}"}], " ", "===", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", " ", "b", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"replaceIndex", "[", 
          RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"SL31TeXToBoxes", "[", 
                RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
               RowBox[{"SL31TeXToBoxes", "[", 
                RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
             " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", "rules", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"LL", "[", 
      RowBox[{"tex_String", ",", " ", "rules___Rule"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ReleaseHold", "[", 
      RowBox[{"SL31SymbolOf", "[", 
       RowBox[{"SL31`Build`symbolBoxes", "[", 
        RowBox[{"tex", ",", " ", "rules"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"End", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"EndPackage", "[", "]"}], ";"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->\
"7406ddfa-9fb5-4ba1-a9cf-f7ca62697a6d"],

Cell["\<\
A first look at the reader: the TeX of six registered symbols and the boxes \
that it builds, shown both as boxes and as they are displayed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"56b53c2c-0871-43d2-979a-a69964d6e22a"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"examples", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\Delta^{\\\\rm vac}_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<A^\\\\iota_{{\\\\rm LL},p}\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<\\\\mathsf N^{\\\\rm g}_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\vec d_{\\\\rm LL})\>\"",
      ",", "\n", "   ", "\"\<\\\\vec d^{\\\\,*}_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<\\\\mathfrak m_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<\\\\lvert\\\\Phi^{\\\\rm SF}_{\\\\rm LL}\\\\rangle\>\""}], 
    "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"SL31TeXToBoxes", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", " ", 
              "InputForm"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"FontFamily", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Source Code Pro\>\""}],
             ",", " ", "9"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"RawBoxes", "[", 
           RowBox[{"SL31TeXToBoxes", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", 
        "&"}], ",", " ", "examples"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
        RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "Bold"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<TeX\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<boxes\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<displayed\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",Expressio\
nUUID->"f582127e-b58c-45f4-9667-2dacddac4e58"],

Cell["I.4 The registry of the symbols", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"71582eea-ad57-468a-a901-831bf771bbb5"],

Cell["\<\
The next cell holds the complete registry of the symbols of the super-loop \
revision: 199 entries. Every entry is an association with the keys \"entry\" \
(its number), \"group\" (one of nine groups), \"symbol\" (the printed forms, \
in TeX, between dollar signs), \"names\" (the plain-text names used by \
programs and data files), \"meaning\", \"meaningEdited\" (True where the \
meaning was restated so that this notebook is complete in itself: the \
original wording pointed to equations, theorems or sections of other texts) \
and \"origin\".\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dd215cfb-672b-40c7-939a-31ba5bd6dad6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "The", " ", "registry", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "symbols", " ", "of", 
     " ", "the", " ", "super"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"loop", " ", 
     RowBox[{"revision", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"199", " ", "entries", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"group", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"TeX", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "symbols"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"plain", "-", 
           RowBox[{"text", " ", "names"}]}], ",", " ", "meaning", ",", " ", 
          "origin"}], ")"}], "."}]}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SL31Registry", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "\n", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<1 Indices, conventions and number sets\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<$i,j$\>\""}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<j\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<j'\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<j''\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<index of space-like coordinates; values 1, 2, 3 (ordinary \
space) unless a sum is said to run over all space-like coordinates of the \
spacetime. In Revision\\\\_SuperLoop only $j$ is used as an index, with the \
values 1, 2, 3, and with primes ($j'$, $j''$) where two or three such indices \
are needed: it labels the three imaginary quaternion units $\\\\mathbf e_j$, \
which correspond to the three space directions of $\\\\mathbb R^{1,3}_{\\\\rm \
LL}$, the coordinates $x^j_{\\\\rm LL}$, the momentum components $q^j_{\\\\rm \
LL}$, the rotation and boost generators $J^j_{\\\\rm LL}$, $K^j_{\\\\rm LL}$, \
and the Pauli matrices $\\\\sigma^{\\\\rm LL}_j$ and Dirac matrices \
$\\\\alpha^j_{\\\\rm LL}$, $\\\\gamma^j_{\\\\rm LL}$. The letter $i$ is the \
imaginary unit (entry $i$); the isospin index is $\\\\iota$ (a different \
letter).\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<taken from the MASTER registry of the main \
project\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "2"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<1 Indices, conventions and number sets\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<$D$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "\"\<D\>\"", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the number of space dimensions in which the particles of \
matter have momentum: 7 (all space coordinates of 7+1), 4 (fields that do not \
depend on $x5,x6,x7$) or 3 (fields that depend on ordinary space only). $V_D=\
\\\\pi^{D/2}/\\\\Gamma_{\\\\rm E}(D/2+1)$ is the volume and $A_D=D\\\\,V_D$ \
the area of the unit ball in $D$ dimensions ($\\\\Gamma_{\\\\rm E}$: Euler's \
gamma function). In the super-loop revision $D=3$ for the four-dimensional \
world of the superfluid and $D=7$ for the eight-dimensional manifolds; the \
value 4, the coordinates $x5,x6,x7$ and the volume and the area of the unit \
ball do not occur. In the kinetic Lagrangian of the superfluid boson singlet \
state $D$ is also continued away from 3: in dimensional regularization the \
momentum integrals are taken in $D$ space dimensions.\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
         
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<taken from the MASTER registry of the revision on the \
deflating spacetimes\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "3"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<1 Indices, conventions and number sets\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<$i$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the imaginary unit, $i^2=-1$; in $\\\\mathbb B_{\\\\rm \
LL}$ it is the imaginary unit of the complex coefficients: it commutes and \
associates with every bi-octonion and is not one of the units $\\\\mathbf \
e_1,\\\\dots,\\\\mathbf e_7$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "4"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<1 Indices, conventions and number sets\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\mathbb R$, $\\\\mathbb C$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<C\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<R^8\>\"",
             ",", " ", "\"\<C^3\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<C^8\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the real and the complex numbers (plain text: `R^8`, \
`C^3`, `C^8` are the real or complex vector spaces of that dimension)\>\""}], 
         ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "5"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<1 Indices, conventions and number sets\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<$p$, $p'$\>\""}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<p'\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<p1\>\"",
             ",", " ", "\"\<p2\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<p3\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<a summation index over the basis of an algebra (values \
$0,\\\\dots,7$, or $0,\\\\dots,3$ for the quaternions): in \
Revision\\\\_SuperLoop it labels the units $\\\\mathbf e_p$ of $\\\\mathbb \
B_{\\\\rm LL}$, the coefficients $\\\\xi^{\\\\rm LL}_p(\\\\mathbf x)$, the \
coordinates $x^p_{\\\\rm LL}$ of $\\\\mathbb R^{1,7}_{\\\\rm LL}$ and \
$\\\\mathbb R^{1,3}_{\\\\rm LL}$ and the Dirac matrices $\\\\gamma^p_{\\\\rm \
LL}$ ($p=0,1,2,3$); $p'$ is a second index of the same kind (plain text `p1`, \
`p2`, `p3`: three such indices)\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "6"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<1 Indices, conventions and number sets\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\iota$, $\\\\iota'$, $\\\\iota''$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
