spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\mathcal H^{\\\\rm DB}_{\\\\rm LL}$, $h^\\\\nabla_{\\\
\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<H_DB\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<h_nabla\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the Dirac-Bogoliubov-de Gennes operator of the mean-field \
