a^{\\\\rm qp}_{{\\\\rm LL},n}+(\\\\psi^{\\\\rm h}_{{\\\\rm LL},n})^*(\\\\hat \
a^{\\\\rm qp}_{{\\\\rm LL},n})^\\\\dagger)$; the quasi-particle vacuum is \
annihilated by every $\\\\hat a^{\\\\rm qp}_{{\\\\rm LL},n}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
