   " ", "\"\<the super-loop form of the Dirac isodoublet and of its field \
equations: (a) a frame matrix is the right multiplication of the spinor \
charge; (b) gamma^p[f] Psi(bSm, bSp) = Psi(bSp conj f_p, bSm f_p); (c) the \
gauge group acts by the automorphisms of the super-loop; (d) the covariant \
derivative acts through the derivations of B_LL; (e) the Dirac operator is \
sum_p R_(f_p) nabla_p (tolerance 1e-12, 1e-10 for (c))\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
   
